  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Truckin'** (1 other source): The noodling passage leading into Truckin' is kept inside the Truckin' track rather than split off [1]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **gd1987-07-04.145604.senn421.hessberg.miller.clugston.flac1648** (recommended): audience recording; 28 songs; 190 min; rated 4/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Bob Dylan played guitar with the band throughout the second set [1]\n- The reviewer says the recording is actually from 4 July 1987, not 1989 as the title states [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **gd1987-07-04.145604.senn421.hessberg.miller.clugston.flac1648**: taped by Michael Hessberg; transferred by Scott Clugston and Charlie Miller; source: Michael Hessberg's Master Audience Cassettes; Sennheiser 421 mics > Sony D5 [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by Grateful Dead: [Grateful Dead Sullivan Stadium - July 2, 1989](https://www.dead.net/show/july-2-1989) [4]",
